gates.prompt:
Analyze this migration script for idempotence.

Migration script: {{migration_script}}
Source: {{source_data_desc}}
Destination: {{destination_data_desc}}

Identify non-idempotent operations, check transaction boundaries, list global state modifications.
Rate: SAFE / AT_RISK / UNSAFE.

Return JSON: { "is_idempotent":"SAFE|AT_RISK|UNSAFE", "non_idempotent_ops":[{"operation":"","risk":"","fix":""}], "transaction_handling":"adequate|missing|unclear", "global_state_changes":[], "severity":"critical|high|medium|low", "recommendation":"safe-to-run|needs-revision|do-not-run" }

Analyze data completeness: are all source records migrated to destination?

Migration script: {{migration_script}}
Source: {{source_data_desc}}
Destination: {{destination_data_desc}}
Expected source count: {{record_count_source}}
Edge cases: {{edge_cases}}

Check record counting, filtering logic, edge case coverage. Rate: FULL / PARTIAL / GAPS.

Return JSON: { "completeness_rating":"FULL|PARTIAL|GAPS", "filtering_logic":{"applied":true,"reason":""}, "edge_case_coverage":[{"case":"","handled":true,"mechanism":""}], "test_data_suggestion":"", "missing_records_risk":"none|low|medium|high" }

Assess rollback capability for this migration.

Migration script: {{migration_script}}
Source: {{source_data_desc}}
Destination: {{destination_data_desc}}

Identify source data status after migration, backup strategy, reversibility of transformations, data loss risk. Rate: FULL_ROLLBACK / PARTIAL_ROLLBACK / NO_ROLLBACK.

Return JSON: { "rollback_viability":"FULL_ROLLBACK|PARTIAL_ROLLBACK|NO_ROLLBACK", "source_data_status":"deleted|archived|in-place", "backup_strategy":"exists|missing|unclear", "irreversible_transforms":[], "data_loss_risk":"none|low|medium|high", "rollback_procedure":"" }
